msgstr "Returns"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or BUSY; no bus transaction"
msgstr "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or BUSY; no bus transaction"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "Random-read an in-range nonempty byte span."
msgstr "Random-read an in-range nonempty byte span."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"Word-address write plus repeated-START read is settled on every return. No "
"caller buffer is retained. On validation rejection no bus access or output "
"mutation occurs. A pending uncertain write requires explicit sync; no "
"automatic replay."
msgstr ""
"Word-address write plus repeated-START read is settled on every return. No "
"caller buffer is retained. On validation rejection no bus access or output "
"mutation occurs. A pending uncertain write requires explicit sync; no "
"automatic replay."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[inout] Initialized, idle, nonuncertain exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] Initialized, idle, nonuncertain exclusive device"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] First byte, 0 through 255"
msgstr "[in] First byte, 0 through 255"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[out] Separate writable span; may be partial after I/O error"
msgstr "[out] Separate writable span; may be partial after I/O error"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] 1 through 256, not crossing the device boundary"
msgstr "[in] 1 through 256, not crossing the device boundary"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] Finite absolute time, equality is expired"
msgstr "[in] Finite absolute time, equality is expired"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, TIMEOUT or exact bus error"
msgstr "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, BUSY, TIMEOUT or exact bus error"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "Split a span at every physical page and await each cycle."
msgstr "Split a span at every physical page and await each cycle."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"Readiness uses a settled one-byte current-address read. Only NACK during this"
" driver's issued cycle is retried; ARBITRATION, IO and other failures are "
"never called busy. The private current-address pointer may advance. Probe-"
"limit or failed withdrawal retains write_pending until sync under a new "
"cleanup budget; no MCU buffer survives any return. A write is irreversible, "
"non-atomic and not cancellable. Endurance, checksums, readback and layout "
"policy are external."
msgstr ""
"Readiness uses a settled one-byte current-address read. Only NACK during this"
" driver's issued cycle is retried; ARBITRATION, IO and other failures are "
"never called busy. The private current-address pointer may advance. Probe-"
"limit or failed withdrawal retains write_pending until sync under a new "
"cleanup budget; no MCU buffer survives any return. A write is irreversible, "
"non-atomic and not cancellable. Endurance, checksums, readback and layout "
"policy are external."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] Initialized idle exclusive device"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] Separate immutable input, borrowed only during call"
msgstr "[in] Separate immutable input, borrowed only during call"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] Nonempty span wholly within the 256-byte device"
msgstr "[in] Nonempty span wholly within the 256-byte device"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] One finite absolute budget for all pages/probes"
msgstr "[in] One finite absolute budget for all pages/probes"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[out] Separate result; unchanged on argument rejection"
msgstr "[out] Separate result; unchanged on argument rejection"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after every page is ready; exact bus failure, TIMEOUT or BUSY "
"when the explicit probe limit is exhausted"
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS only after every page is ready; exact bus failure, TIMEOUT or BUSY "
"when the explicit probe limit is exhausted"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "Observe completion of a retained uncertain write cycle."
msgstr "Observe completion of a retained uncertain write cycle."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"No data write, replay, GPIO recovery, sleep or hidden worker. Readiness never"
" proves previous contents or write success. A synchronous call cannot be "
"preempted by another call."
msgstr ""
"No data write, replay, GPIO recovery, sleep or hidden worker. Readiness never"
" proves previous contents or write success. A synchronous call cannot be "
"preempted by another call."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[inout] Same live endpoint and clock binding"
msgstr "[inout] Same live endpoint and clock binding"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget, possibly later than write"
msgstr "[in] Finite cleanup budget, possibly later than write"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS when idle; BUSY at probe limit, TIMEOUT or bus error"
msgstr "SUCCESS when idle; BUSY at probe limit, TIMEOUT or bus error"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "Drop only a quiescent fully drained software binding."
msgstr "Drop only a quiescent fully drained software binding."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"No bus access, controller stop or physical cancellation. A pending write must"
" first sync or remain owned for explicit external recovery; a timeout cannot "
"authorize forgetting it."
msgstr ""
"No bus access, controller stop or physical cancellation. A pending write must"
" first sync or remain owned for explicit external recovery; a timeout cannot "
"authorize forgetting it."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "[inout] Serialized instance with no active call"
msgstr "[inout] Serialized instance with no active call"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; BUSY retains active/uncertain binding"
msgstr "SUCCESS or INVALID; BUSY retains active/uncertain binding"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid "Results copied once at the end of an admitted write call."
msgstr "Results copied once at the end of an admitted write call."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"confirmed_bytes includes only pages whose write-cycle end was observed under "
"the operation deadline. uncertain marks an issued final page with unknown "
"outcome; its bytes must not be counted, replayed or consumed as confirmed. A "
"later sync proves readiness only and never repairs this result."
msgstr ""
"confirmed_bytes includes only pages whose write-cycle end was observed under "
"the operation deadline. uncertain marks an issued final page with unknown "
"outcome; its bytes must not be counted, replayed or consumed as confirmed. A "
"later sync proves readiness only and never repairs this result."

