msgid "Project the synchronous strict-I2C face for one child."
msgstr "Project the synchronous strict-I2C face for one child."

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"No discovery, allocation or hardware start. Face, child, owner, config and "
"contexts outlive all calls. Transactions use 1..8 messages of 1..256 bytes, "
"repeated START between messages and one final STOP. transferred counts "
"completed payload bytes, excluding address phases; partial reads may remain "
"on error. All spans release even when STOP fails, while the physical bus "
"owner remains faulted and retained. Async submit/start are unsupported, never"
" a stack fallback."
msgstr ""
"No discovery, allocation or hardware start. Face, child, owner, config and "
"contexts outlive all calls. Transactions use 1..8 messages of 1..256 bytes, "
"repeated START between messages and one final STOP. transferred counts "
"completed payload bytes, excluding address phases; partial reads may remain "
"on error. All spans release even when STOP fails, while the physical bus "
"owner remains faulted and retained. Async submit/start are unsupported, never"
